        </affected>
        <reference source="CVE" ref_id="CVE-1999-0710" ref_url="https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-1999-0710"/>
        <description>The Squid package in Red Hat Linux 5.2 and 6.0, and other distributions, installs cachemgr.cgi in a public web directory, which allows remote attackers to use it as an intermediary to connect to other systems.</description>
